Subject: [PATCH 14/18] nockchain: keep public binding in prover metadata

Circuit prover setup now builds the primitive Public AIR with the same public_binding_lanes used during proving. ProverData therefore derives quotient degrees and symbolic constraints for the proof shape actually emitted when the recursive certificate binds statement limbs as STARK public values.

diff --git a/circuit-prover/src/common.rs b/circuit-prover/src/common.rs
index 991d05278b52e4c11696d9bc73a3396242ad8f80..9a22f1909429a168527e6a091a00406568a76ebf 100644
--- a/circuit-prover/src/common.rs
+++ b/circuit-prover/src/common.rs
@@ -341,6 +341,7 @@ where
                     effective_public_lanes,
                     base_prep[idx].clone(),
                 )
+                .with_public_binding_lanes(packing.public_binding_lanes())
                 .with_min_height(min_height);
                 let num_rows = num_ops.div_ceil(effective_public_lanes);
                 table_preps.push((
